      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Going to the movies with my best friend is always quite a scene. You know, whenever I get nervous I can't stop eating popcorn, really fast, and the cola in my hand starts shaking too and nearly spills, I mean really nearly. Then the person next to us suddenly goes \"shh\" in this really low voice. Honestly, in that moment I wanted to laugh and was a little annoyed at the same time. So awkward.",
